00:54:17.920 --> 00:54:22.580
And that first page just has all of Sprinkles, like medicines and how to care for her.

1283
00:54:23.600 --> 00:54:25.200
Oh, my gosh.

1284
00:54:25.460 --> 00:54:26.000
Oh, look.

