Well, Greg told me that he had the writer's assistants, Nate Fetterman and Jonathan Hughes,

1306
00:55:14.200 --> 00:55:21.240
do research into the accurate cat medicines, and that is why that list of medicines is so

1307
00:55:21.240 --> 00:55:21.700
realistic.

1308
00:55:21.960 --> 00:55:23.740
Well, good job, writer's assistants.

1309
00:55:24.300 --> 00:55:25.260
That's right.

