John eats popcorn.

1325
00:56:11.860 --> 00:56:13.100
Oh, my gosh.

1326
00:56:13.900 --> 00:56:18.160
Did you notice he is eating popcorn through this whole scene?

1327
00:56:18.340 --> 00:56:20.880
Not carrots, not baby carrots, but popcorn.

1328
00:56:21.020 --> 00:56:26.700
And the way he's eating it, it's so, it's so delicate.

1329
00:56:27.380 --> 00:56:29.880
Was he trying not to crunch too loudly?

1330
00:56:30.240 --> 00:56:35.580
I think he was trying not to be a problem for sound, but he was clearly hungry because he eats

1331
00:56:35.580 --> 00:56:37.220
it through the whole scene.

1332
00:56:37.480 --> 00:56:38.300
Oh, my God.

1333
00:56:38.420 --> 00:56:42.280
Was this the year we got that little popcorn maker by Kraft Services?

1334
00:56:43.500 --> 00:56:44.580
It must have been.

1335
