We went a little crazy for popcorn, and then the sound department, I think, said, okay,

1337
00:56:52.120 --> 00:56:52.480
guys.

1338
00:56:53.080 --> 00:56:54.560
I remember it went away.

1339
00:56:54.560 --> 00:56:56.860
Yeah, but we were excited about it.

1340
00:56:57.120 --> 00:57:01.560
Well, he's eating popcorn in this whole scene, and it's also in this scene that Pam explains

1341
